We need to fix the Invoice Document Template Designer because several design properties are currently buggy or do not reliably update the backend-generated sample preview.

The affected properties are:

- Font family
- Font size
- Font color
- Logo width
- Logo height

The goal is to make these properties fully controlled by the designer state and ensure that every change is reflected in:

Designer State
    ↓
Sample Preview Request
    ↓
POST /api/document-templates/{templateId}/sample-preview
    ↓
Backend Thymeleaf rendering
    ↓
iframe preview

Do not implement a frontend-only visual approximation. The backend-generated HTML must actually reflect these values.

